- elementId: top-bar
  elementType: shape
  bounds: [0, 0, 1280, 6]
  shapeName: rect
  fill:
    type: solid
    color: $primary
- elementId: badge-bg
  elementType: shape
  bounds: [60, 14, 120, 22]
  shapeName: rect
  fill:
    type: solid
    color: $primary
- elementId: badge-text
  elementType: text
  bounds: [60, 14, 120, 22]
  content:
    fontSize: 12
    color: #FFFFFF
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.0
    align: [center, middle]
    wrap: False
    text: |
      CH12
- elementId: bg-title
  elementType: text
  bounds: [60, 40, 300, 35]
  content:
    fontSize: 24
    color: $primary
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.5
    wrap: True
    text: |
      <p><strong>研究背景</strong></p>
- elementId: bg-body
  elementType: text
  bounds: [60, 80, 1160, 230]
  content:
    fontSize: 18
    color: $text
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.5
    wrap: True
    text: |
      <ul>
      <li>one-sided static 预注册大 slab，runtime 不用 MNode CPU，但 internal fragmentation 导致 remote memory utilization 低。</li>
      <li>one-sided dynamic 细化 allocation 粒度，但 memory registration 是 control path 操作，4KB 或 1MB MR 注册代价很高。</li>
      <li>two-sided 可做到 4KB 粒度，但每次 swap 请求都要 MNode CPU 参与，CPU 很快成为瓶颈。</li>
      <li>研究问题：能否同时获得 fine-grained utilization、zero MNode CPU 和 good performance。</li>
      </ul>
- elementId: sep-line
  elementType: shape
  bounds: [60, 330, 1160, 1]
  shapeName: rect
  fill:
    type: solid
    color: $border
- elementId: sol-title
  elementType: text
  bounds: [60, 350, 300, 35]
  content:
    fontSize: 24
    color: $primary
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.5
    wrap: True
    text: |
      <p><strong>解决方案</strong></p>
- elementId: sol-body
  elementType: text
  bounds: [60, 390, 1160, 260]
  content:
    fontSize: 18
    color: $text
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.5
    wrap: True
    text: |
      <ul>
      <li>MNode 把内存切成 4KB pages，用 FIFO free page queue 管空闲页，并为每个 CNode 维护 translation table。</li>
      <li>CNode backend 维护 allocation bitmap，提前判断 mapped/unmapped store，避免 WR chain 内额外分支。</li>
      <li>RNIC WR chain 用 READ/WRITE/CAS/FAA 等 primitives 实现 page load、mapped store、unmapped store、invalidate。</li>
      <li>EndianSwap、Modulo WR 和 WR recycling 克服 RNIC semantics 限制。</li>
      </ul>
- elementId: source
  elementType: text
  bounds: [60, 690, 1160, 20]
  content:
    fontSize: 14
    color: $secondary
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.2
    wrap: True
    text: |
      来源：ODRP (ASPLOS 2025)｜证据等级：E1 / Peer-reviewed
- elementId: bottom-bar
  elementType: shape
  bounds: [0, 714, 1280, 6]
  shapeName: rect
  fill:
    type: solid
    color: $primary
